        "edit": "In the always block, change the s==1'B0 branch assignment from y=a to y=b, correcting the inverted mux select polarity so s==0 selects b.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n    \n        \n\nif(s==1'B0)begin y=b;end\n        \n\n\t\nendmodule",
